[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0299","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3624","title":"Apple iTunes WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Apple iTunes 10.7 之前版本所使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，诱使用户在 iTunes 中打开或预览特制内容，从而触发堆或栈内存越界访问，导致应用程序拒绝服务或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有未及时安装 Apple 安全更新的 iTunes 用户，攻击无需预先获取系统权限，但需要用户主动访问攻击者控制的恶意链接才能触发利用过程。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3624"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-13T10:30:19Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:36Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Apple iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本，以修复 WebKit 内存损坏漏洞。升级路径为：打开 iTunes，依次点击「帮助」→「检查更新」，或直接从 Apple 官网下载安装最新版 iTunes。如暂无法升级，应避免使用 iTunes 访问不受信任的网站，并可在防火墙或代理中限制 iTunes 对已知恶意域名的访问，同时及时安装操作系统安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://osvdb.org/85398","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78545","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3624.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3624","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3624.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3624.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3624","https://github.com/kees/ubu