执行漏洞","description":"Apple iTunes 10.7 之前版本所集成的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞（CWE-119）。远程攻击者可构造恶意网站，当用户在 iTunes 内置浏览器中访问该页面时，WebKit 在处理特制网页内容过程中触发内存损坏，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码或导致应用程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分高达 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3621"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-13T10:30:19Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:35Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Apple iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本，通过 Apple Software Update 或访问 apple.com/itunes/download 下载最新版本。如暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 iTunes 进程的出站网络连接，或暂时禁用 iTunes 访问不可信网站作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Jan/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5642","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78536","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17523","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3621.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3621","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3621.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3621.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3621","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3621","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3621","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3621.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3621.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-3621"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0296.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0293","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0293.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3617","title":"Apple iTunes WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Apple iTunes 在 10.7 版本之前使用的 WebKit 组件存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网站向目标系统发送特制网页内容，触发 WebKit 渲染引擎中的内存损坏，导致应用程序崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行旧版 iOS（6.0 之前）和 iTunes（10.7 之前）的设备，攻击者无需身份认证即可在用户访问恶意网页时利用此漏洞，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中等。攻击条件为攻击者控制恶意网站并诱使用户访问，利用方式为通过特制网页触发内存损坏实现代码执行或拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3617"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-13T10:30:19Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:35Z","remediation":"升级 Apple iTunes 至 10.7 或更高版本：Mac 用户通过 Mac App Store 检查并安装 iTunes 更新，Windows 用户前往 Apple 官网下载最新版安装包覆盖安装。如暂时无法升级，应避免使用 iTunes 访问不可信网页内容，并禁用不必要的 WebKit 浏览器组件以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://osvdb.org/85410","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78547","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e4