AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0290","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3614","title":"Apple iTunes WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iTunes 10.7之前版本使用的WebKit渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，触发WebKit在处理网页内容时发生内存损坏，进而执行任意代码或导致应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行Apple iOS及macOS系统的设备，攻击者无需身份认证即可在目标系统上获得与当前用户相同的权限，CVSS评分6.8，危害等级为高危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3614"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-13T10:30:19Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本，iOS 设备升级至 6.0 或更高版本，并安装 Apple 2012 年 9 月安全更新（APPLE-SA-2012-09-12-1）。临时缓解措施包括避免在旧版 iTunes 或 Safari 中打开未知网站链接，禁用不必要的 WebKit 内容渲染，或通过防火墙限制对恶意网站的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://osvdb.org/85408","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78513","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16983","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3614.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3614","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3614.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3614.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3614","https://github.