description":"Apple iTunes 10.7 之前版本所使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可构造恶意网页内容，当用户使用 iTunes 浏览包含特制代码的网页时，触发内存损坏，从而导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有未及时更新的 iTunes 用户，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络发起攻击，利用中等复杂度即可成功执行任意代码或造成服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3602"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-09-13T10:30:19Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:33Z","remediation":"将 Apple iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 WebKit 中多个内存损坏问题。对于 iOS 设备，请升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议暂时避免在 iTunes 中访问恶意网站，并禁用不必要的 WebKit 相关内容渲染功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00005.html","http://osvdb.org/85414","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5502","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55534","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78558","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16532","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3602.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3602","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3602.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3602.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3602","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3602","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/r